{"id":"versager","lemma":"Versager","pos":"noun","rank":2958,"glosses":["loser, failure, deadbeat (someone who fails)"],"ipa":"/fɛɐ̯ˈzaːɡɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fd/De-Versager.ogg/De-Versager.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Versagers","plural":"Versager"},"examples":[{"text":"Frauen mögen keine Versager.","en":"Women don't like losers.","words":[{"g":"woman","l":"Frau"},{"g":"to like"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Ich glaube, Tom ist ein Versager.","en":"I think Tom is a loser.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Man kann nur schwer mit dem Wissen leben, ein Versager zu sein.","en":"It's hard to live with the knowledge that you're a failure.","words":[{"g":"one"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"heavy, weighty"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"to know"},{"g":"a state in which…"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Tom ist so ein Versager!","en":"Tom is such a loser.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"so"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tom ist ein echter Versager.","en":"Tom is a complete loser.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"authentic","l":"echt"},null]}]}